<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - May 2.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - May 2.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement in trading upto (0700 GMT) on Friday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during this period and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The latest index was 3805.06  36.05 points or 0.94 percent lower than Wednesday's close</p>
<p>.</p>
